<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Banking 96 net at 261 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine Banking 96 net at 261 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Banking Corp posted a net income of 261.262 million pesos in 1996, documents submitted to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Thursday showed.</p>
<p>Operating income was at 1.223 billion pesos, while operating expenses amounted to 1.028 billion pesos. The company said it made some extraordinary gains from the sale of property during the year.</p>
<p>The company did not give any comparative figures.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
